              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo Daudi ŵamsalile mundu jwa mtenga jula kuti, “Mkasalile Yowabu kuti, ‘Akadandawula nayo yeleyi, pakuŵa jwakuwa jwangamanyika. Mlimbicile kulimbana nawo msindawo, ni kuwupunda pa ngondo.’ Myoyo mkamlimbisye mtima Yowabujo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
